    "description": "good condition- may need cleaning; may show signs of age/wear such as scratches, scuffs, and discoloration\n***Disclaimer and Store Notes, PLEASE READ***\nAll items are donated and are in pre-owned condition (unless noted otherwise). We list items as they are received; we DO NOT guarantee we disassembled or investigated inner components of any items including but not limited to household items, electronics, etc. ALL Items may have unknown components, unknown materials, etc.  Electronics ARE NOT TESTED OR GUARANTEED TO WORK. IF we note \"tested\" it means ONLY that the item powers on. By bidding, the buyer indicates they understand and assumes this risk. We will not accept returns due to bids made based on assumptions, so please ask all questions prior to bidding.\nGrab bags may contain a variety of items-Jewelry, Accessories, etc- and are not guaranteed to be of any specific value or condition. May have wearable items, New with Tags, broken items, tangled items, etc. Watches are not tested and are not guaranteed to be any specific condition. We are unable to photograph or provide details for individual items in bulk lots but have provided photos to give a representation of what is included. Please note that bulk lots are sold as-is and no returns will be accepted so please ask all questions prior to bidding.\nIf you have questions regarding this item please contact us PRIOR to placing your bid using the Contact link on the item listing page. While we respond as quickly & thoroughly as possible, please do not expect a response in less than 48 hours and we do not guarantee that we will be able to provide the information requested. Please take this into account when bidding.\nWe do not offer pick up at this time.\nItems may contain unseen flaws/damage not noted in listing. Photos are part of the description. It is expected that buyers will do their own research as well and/or ask any questions prior to placing a bid. Do not bid if you are not confident in the information provided.\nWe DO NOT retract winning bids and will only retract bids prior to auction end if we are able during our normal business hours. RETRACTIONS ARE NOT GUARANTEED IN ANY INSTANCE. WE DO NOT REMOVE UNPAID ITEMS.\n\"Tested\" indicates ONLY that the item has been powered on; no further testing or assessment of function has been done unless noted.\nWe do our best to accurately identify items but cannot guarantee complete or exact identification or function as we are not experts and we can only test items in a limited capacity.\nWe are not able to provide individual item details on multi item lots. BULK LOTS ARE NOT ELIGIBLE FOR RETURNS OR REFUNDS. It is likely they will contain tangled and broken items, as well as incomplete sets/pairs.\nMeasurements for items are approximated. While we do our best to provide sizes for single item lots, we cannot do so for multi item lots.\nIf sizes are not listed in the title or description, or shown in a photo, then we are unable to provide them\nWe do our best to show the true color/condition/etc of items in photos, but we are not expert photographers and items may appear different in person.\nALL ITEMS ARE SOLD AS IS.\n*We offer combined shipping up to 20lbs shipping weight for most items for a significantly reduced shipping rate.\n**WE DO NOT REMOVE, REDUCE, OR ALTER HANDLING FEES REGARDLESS OF THE NUMBER OF ITEMS PURCHASED. We DO NOT combine shipping after payment; all items must be combined at time of payment. If an item does not allow you to combine when paying it is because the item is not eligible.\nRequests for combined shipping after payment WILL NOT be honored. We are sorry for any inconvenience.**\n**Please retain ALL packaging (boxes, paper, etc) until you have confirmed your order is complete and correct. We will require photos of these items if a return or refund request is made, and your request will be denied if you are unable or unwilling to provide the required photos. Please see full return policy near bottom of disclaimer.**\n*Orders over $100 may have signature confirmation at no expense to you to better protect your purchase. Please contact us PRIOR to shipment if you decline this service, with the understanding that we are not able to file claims or issue refunds for mis-delivered items if sig conf is declined. We are not able to remove signature conf or change shipping address after the item has left our location.\nIf a package is returned to us due to being undeliverable (e.g. non-pickup by recipient; unavailability of recipient; incorrect address entered by buyer; etc), we will issue a refund of the bid price only and the item will be relisted.\n*\"UNTESTED\" indicates that the item's FUNCTION has not been tested in any way. It has not been turned on or had the function tested IN ANY WAY unless otherwise stated in the listing. This does not refer to any metal or gem testing.\n*We describe gold and silver to the best of our ability. If there is not a test result on the listing or if \"tested\" is not explicitly stated in a precious metal listing, please assume the item was listed based on marking(s), magnet testing, & research.\nPrecious metal jewelry may have resin, wax, or other cores; if we do not state this, it is because we do not know. We provide a total weight of the item, which is the weight of all components of the item, stated and unstated (unknown).\n*Imperfections may be noted in writing or shown in photos.\n*Total weight (TW) includes gems, stones, embellishments, other metals/materials, clasps, etc\n*Gems are tested w/ Presidium Gem Tester II. PGTII does not differentiate between natural and lab-created gems. Gems may be natural or lab created, we are not experts in this or any other field and list gems based on the PGTII results.\n*Watches, electronics, etc are Untested for function and are Sold As-Is, no returns\n*Items may contain original or replacement parts.\n*Props/rulers/scales/coins used to show scale are not included.\n*Unless otherwise stated, please assume metals and gems are NOT precious or semi precious.\n*Please note that any listings that include a metal analysis reading from our Niton™ DXL Precious Metal Analyzer will NOT be eligible for return on the basis of metal tests done by the buyer (e.g. acid tests, etc) unless they are done on the same or more advanced spectrometer, as this type of testing is highly accurate. Barring special circumstances, returns will only be considered in these instances if a reading on such a machine or a certificate can be provided from a licensed jeweler saying how the item is different than stated in the listing. If providing results from your own machine we will require photographic proof of the metal reading, proof of the type of analyzer, and proof of date of last calibration. We are not responsible for any costs incurred when getting the item tested. All questions regarding the accuracy, composition, authenticity or any other query must be asked PRIOR to placing any bids on the item*\nReturns:\nMost items not eligible for return.\nReturns will only be accepted with\nprior authorization\nand under the terms stated in this Return Policy. Please contact us\non Shopgoodwill\nwithin seven (7) days of receipt\nif the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description.\nWe may ask you for additional information/photos of the item, so\nplease do not throw away the packaging or alter any part of the shipment\n.\nWe require return packages to be postmarked within 5 business days of return approval and that you send us your tracking number as confirmation.\nIn the instance of a damaged item or a significant error in description we\nmay\nrefund the original shipping & handling costs; this will be noted in our response to your return request.\nPlease note that we do not refund return shipping costs.\nOnce your return is processed (may take up to 7 days after delivery), we will issue the agreed upon refund and message you to let you know.\nPlease note that the item must match what was sent to you (i.e. condition, size/weight, type, model, etc).\nWe reserve the right to deny all returns that do not meet these requirements or that were not authorized beforehand. We reserve the right to assess restocking fees and to retain all S&H charges if the buyer does not follow these return procedures.\nIf you return an item to us without authorization the item will not be returned to you and no refund will be issued.\nThere may be a restocking fee depending on the terms of your return; this will be disclosed to you if it applies in our message regarding your return approval/denial.\nTHE BUYER IS RESPONSIBLE FOR ALL RETURN SHIPPING COSTS.\nTerms of Sale\nOrders must be paid for within seven (7) days from close of auction and will be shipped within five business days after receipt of payment.\nBuy it Now items must be paid for by the end of the listing, or they may be relisted or otherwise unavailable.\nAll orders not paid within the time limit from the close of auction will be resold without further notice and we will not remove unpaid items from accounts. We are unable to offer in person pick up at this time and orders will not be canceled due to failure to read this disclaimer.\nYour purchase allows Goodwill Industries of Kentucky to fulfill our mission and help people with disabilities or other disadvantages achieve and maintain employment to gain a better quality of life. Thank you for your support!",
